{"id": "03", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[calm] Update available. [pause] Reality HUD, version one point zero."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "That night, a strange update popped up. [pause] Terms and conditions: four thousand, eight hundred and twelve pages."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[casual] Accept. [pause] Nobody reads those."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] Nobody reads those."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "Installing... [pause] reality."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "The next morning... everything had stats."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[amazed] My bed has stats. My SOCK has stats. [pause] My alarm clock is an ENEMY?!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] The toaster had an eighty percent chance to burn. [pause] It burned."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Mom was smiling. [pause] Her energy was two percent."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[cheerful, tired] Good morning, sweetheart!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] Each coffee gave her one percent. [pause] She drank four. [pause] Six percent. A new record."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Grandpa was level eighty-seven. [pause] And Max had infinite health."}, {"speaker": "GRANDPA", "text": "[suspicious, old] Why are you staring at the top of my head?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quickly] No reason! [pause] Nice... hair, Grandpa."}, {"speaker": "GRANDPA", "text": "[deadpan] I don't have hair."}, {"speaker": "MAX", "text": "[tiny voice, shouting] Watch this!"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[whispering, amazed] This... is... AMAZING."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] Biscuit's stats didn't even load. [pause] Error. Too good."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 4.720000000000001, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 69, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 4.720000000000001, "en